{"id": "34020", "title": "官人止步", "author": "安琪", "category": "文学名著", "count": 48, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34020.htm", "intro": "一张熟悉的容颜，唤醒了房振群尘封的记忆──那个有著天使面孔、却始终以哀戚眼神望著他的女子，竟是让他每每从梦中惊醒，且挥之不去她面容的佳人?! 就算他贵为科技新贵，在命运的奇妙之前也不得不臣服…… 他深信，这一世重生全是为了她──但当他做尽一切，这女人竟对他满腔热情视而不见，他只好……丁梧桐打从小开始，就常常梦见自己坐在房中哭泣。哪知遇上他后，熟悉的椎心之痛更是时刻啃噬著自己；他好像曾狠狠伤害她，但他的刻骨柔情却又令她眷恋不已。即使心早已沦陷，她仍旧绝情寡义地抛下他远去──但抗拒真的有用吗？她哪里知道，再见面时，他竟然……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34020", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2164034.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2164035.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2164036.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2164037.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2164038.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2164039.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2164040.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2164041.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2164042.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2164043.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2164044.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2164045.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2164046.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2164047.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2164048.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2164049.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2164050.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2164051.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2164052.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2164053.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2164054.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2164055.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2164056.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2164057.html", "available": false}